OL,3,GNEWSATown pulls together to feed fire
OL,4,Acrews at Holme Fen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community has really "pulled
OL,7,Ftogether" to offer hot meals and
OL,8,Frefreshments to firefighters working on
OL,9,Fa major fire at a nature reserve, a
OL,10,Fcouncil clerk has said.
OL,12,FLisa Renfree, from Ramsey Town Council,
OL,13,Fsaid a fundraising effort had raised
OL,14,Fnearly #4,000 to feed about 70
OL,15,Ffirefighters who have working at Holme
OL,16,FFen Nature Reserve, near Peterborough,
OL,17,Ffor over a week.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
