OL,3,GNEWSATown pulls together to feed fire
OL,4,Acrews at Holme Fen
OL,5,
OL,6,FRenfree said a new kitchen at the
OL,7,Fcommunity centre in Ramsey,
OL,8,FCambridgeshire, had become a hub for
OL,9,Fcooking batches of jacket potatoes
OL,10,Fwhich were then delivered to a pub in
OL,11,FHolme for the crews.
OL,13,F"We have been overwhelmed with offers
OL,14,Ffrom residents and businesses just
OL,15,Fsimply asking, 'how can we help?'" she
OL,16,Fsaid.
